      "after": "<div><h1>关卡01 首次进入厨房</h1><h1><div><img src=\"assets/28ce240f5f98c9e5bd78e5da07c598bd59047ca0fa147174b961a8f6e9b044e7.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><img src=\"assets/41073df638eb4fede1a164ca47b00d9e4eb3e7fb1ce02a0189ecfa2aab6fec95.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/850b91222a20abab209303c1a16ead85a05a382c27a3b78af4758c792a4c910b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">对接口PIN密码<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/13dd333fc526c4fdd91b54d7fe6a7be41d246aff329ff32bcef1bba9b0a3aa15.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">先不要点停靠系统</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/0706cc44f887bccae343e43ab6b95a4c650ffe79d15e193c7e424c123b77e57e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">先在1楼休息室区域拿电池1，然后去机器人区域</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/6585b20b9d65290dbccbda086799a40a8cdec8ab58c49958295891e8cd84e1f7.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">机器人区域，插入电池1、电池2<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/23956ce15be52e2c48d2898049e038a3fcd525b8c390a1152f30f2d434218349.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">去培育区，拿电池3，再返回机器人区域，插入电池3</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/0631d191c93c1b6c5fce4ede4792a2b710fc3c8317af9e36bbcf6e6d929e46df.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>打开药箱，获取船舱通行权限</span></div></div></div></h1></div>"
